/** Defers an OPEN claim until a date after the sheet's today (a deferred one may be deferred again).
 *  A claim not OPEN, a date not after today, or a claim due by in a closed period is refused. */
== ApplyClaimHold
/** Holds an OPEN or PENDING claim, or releases a held one. Refused: a claim in any other status. */
== ApplyClaimLine
/** Adds the line to the claim, as an edit of it: refused when another user's editor locks it, it is no
 *  longer a DRAFT, or it is due by in a closed period. The claim's amount becomes its lines' quantities
 *  times their unit amounts added up, and the adding user becomes its last editor. */
== ApplyClaimLock
/** Opens the claim's editor for the user, locking the claim for everyone else; refused (taking no
 *  lock) when another user's editor locks it, it is no longer a DRAFT, or it is due by in a closed period. */
    /** Refuse a change by `user` to a claim another user's open editor locks. */
== ApplyClaimProof
/** Raises the claim's proofs count by one, of the kind chosen (a receipt when none is). A SETTLED, VOID or DELETED claim, or one dated in a closed period, is refused. */
== ApplyClaimReassign
/** Moves a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim to another person on the sheet; only the roles the permission matrix allows may (a steward by
 *  default). The
 *  claim keeps its date, takes the next number in its sequence (see {@link ClaimNumbers}; its old
 *  number is never used again, and a draft has none to renumber), but loses any figure a statement bound it to: it is live again
 *  until its new person's next statement. A SETTLED or VOID claim cannot move, nor a claim dated in
 *  a closed period, nor one dated after its new person's retirement date. */
