     *  closed period, or dated after its new person's retirement, stays where it is. */
== ApplyClaimRedate
/** A steward re-dates an OPEN or PENDING claim. Its due-by stays as it was fixed and a figure a
 *  statement bound stays bound; so does its period (the one containing its due-by) and its number.
 *  Refused: anyone but a steward, a claim not OPEN or PENDING, a claim due by in a closed period,
 *  or a new date after its person's retirement. */
== ApplyClaimRemind
/** Reminds an OPEN or PENDING claim on the sheet's today, once per sheet-today. A claim in any other
 *  status, or one already reminded on the sheet's today, is refused. While the sheet has an escalation gap,
 *  a claim not yet escalated whose previous reminder was at least that many days before the sheet's today
 *  is escalated. */
== ApplyClaimResettle
/** Re-settles a SETTLED claim: only a steward may, and never one due by in a closed period. Its due is
 *  fixed again at the figure it would have today as an OPEN claim bound by no statement: the rate of
