226	   153	     *  member has a cut at all (null); each other member's is the pot times their share divided by
227	   154	     *  the shares of the members with a cut added up, rounded half to even to two decimals. The
228	   155	     *  remainder, the pot less the cuts, goes to the member with the smallest non-zero cut, the latest
229	   156	     *  added on a tie (the last member with a cut when every cut is 0.00), so the cuts total the pot
